# Deny by default: this repo is public (served by GitHub Pages), so nothing is
# published unless it is explicitly allowlisted below as a deployable.
#
# Covers agent internals (CLAUDE.md, docs/agents/, .scratch/), IDE config
# (.idea/), and anything added later — no need to update this file when a new
# tool starts writing output here.
/*

# --- Deployables: the files GitHub Pages actually serves ---
!/index.html

# Keep this file itself tracked so the rule travels with the repo.
!/.gitignore

# To publish a new asset, add it here, e.g.:
# !/assets/
# !/favicon.ico
# !/.nojekyll
